{"script":"yd_011_08-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":160,"y":-206,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":160,"transTime":300,"y":-206,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]比起普通的秘术师，缇莎有一点非常特殊。[r]那就是对魔法的存在非常敏感，哪怕是大自然中那极其微弱的魔法，缇莎都能感觉到。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎甚至能感受到属于魔法的“感情”。[r]在缇莎看来，魔法其实也是有生命的，只不过它们的生命表现形式和我们不一样而已。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎就经常和它们沟通哦，虽然我们听不懂彼此的话语，但那种和朋友一起聊天的感觉真的不错。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]{myName}也一起来感受一下吧，来和缇莎一起感受自然的魔力……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":160,"transTime":300,"y":-206,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"缇莎-自然的魔力"}